    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        133,
        1510,
        1559,
        1664
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, under Section 504 of the Rehabilitation Act of 1973, as amended, codified at 29 U.S.C. \u00a7 794, and its implementing regulations, 34 C.F.R. Part. 104, an impartial due process complaint may be filed by a parent or guardian of a qualified student with a disability on any matter relating to the identification, evaluation, or educational placement of such student; and",
